{"4393700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elderfeast", "steam_appid": 4393700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/92d58a6d20ea261923d9e4e8eb32c068.poster.avif?t=1787115420\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/92d58a6d20ea261923d9e4e8eb32c068.webm?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/92d58a6d20ea261923d9e4e8eb32c068.mp4?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Order of the Void Eaters</strong>, chef!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track and carve an array of Lovecraftian-inspired horrors across the galaxy, then discover what they taste like. Face the Eldritch horrors alone or join fellow chefs online for cooperative play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/99d7acf8b2b782290f19f1b076603b01.poster.avif?t=1787115420\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/99d7acf8b2b782290f19f1b076603b01.webm?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/99d7acf8b2b782290f19f1b076603b01.mp4?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dismember limbs, tentacles, and organs mid-combat, weakening your enemies while stocking your pantry with the freshest  ingredients. From the heavy, limb-chopping butcher knife to the nimble organ-extracting harpoon gun, there are plenty of options for how to prepare your next meal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/c6178877124d853ab24f4c676c6976ed.poster.avif?t=1787115420\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/c6178877124d853ab24f4c676c6976ed.webm?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/c6178877124d853ab24f4c676c6976ed.mp4?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique immersive in-world cooking grid rewards clever placement and creative combinations, turning your hard-earned ingredients into something extraordinary. Master the cooking system to craft dishes that enhance your abilities, turning every successful recipe into a step toward becoming a more formidable chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/9ee1c060ea68e6f549a2662c632557fc.poster.avif?t=1787115420\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/9ee1c060ea68e6f549a2662c632557fc.webm?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/9ee1c060ea68e6f549a2662c632557fc.mp4?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true living ecosystem where monsters will eat anyone and anything. Feed them toxic ingredients, poisoned meals, and other creatures or you'll find yourself at the top of the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/f09c963ab175aae8d07ab78756614c32.poster.avif?t=1787115420\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/f09c963ab175aae8d07ab78756614c32.webm?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/f09c963ab175aae8d07ab78756614c32.mp4?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the cultish chef conclave known as the Order of the Void Eaters as you journey to become the ultimate explorer, monster slayer, and chef.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/92d58a6d20ea261923d9e4e8eb32c068.poster.avif?t=1787115420\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/92d58a6d20ea261923d9e4e8eb32c068.webm?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393700/extras/92d58a6d20ea261923d9e4e8eb32c068.mp4?t=1787115420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Order of the Void Eaters</strong>, chef!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track and carve an array of Lovecraftian-inspired horrors across the galaxy, then discover what they taste like. Face the Eldritch horrors alone or join fellow chefs online for cooperative play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c